ISO/IEC 42001:2023 Annex A catalog
==================================

Source
------
ISO/IEC 42001:2023, Information technology — Artificial intelligence —
Management system. Annex A (Reference control objectives and controls).
https://www.iso.org/standard/81230.html

Copyright / licensing status
----------------------------
ISO/IEC 42001:2023 is COPYRIGHTED by ISO and IEC. Its normative text is sold
under licence and may NOT be reproduced. This catalog therefore deliberately
contains NO ISO/IEC normative text.

What this catalog contains
--------------------------
- The Annex A control IDENTIFIERS (e.g. A.2.2, A.6.2.4, A.10.3) and the SHORT
  control names. Identifiers and short control names are used here as factual
  references for interoperability, not as a substitute for the standard.
- ORIGINAL one-line summaries and descriptions authored for this project. These
  are our own paraphrase of each control's intent; they are NOT the ISO text.
- `frameworkRefs.iso42001Clause` records the Annex A clause number, plus our own
  editorial cross-references to other catalogs (FINOS AIGF, NIST AI RMF,
  MITRE ATLAS).

What this catalog does NOT contain and is NOT
---------------------------------------------
- It does not reproduce the requirements, guidance, or wording of ISO/IEC 42001.
- It is not a copy of, or a substitute for, the standard. Organizations seeking
  to conform to or be certified against ISO/IEC 42001 must obtain the official
  standard from ISO or an authorized national body.

Attribution
-----------
Where surfaced to users, attribute as:
"Control structure based on ISO/IEC 42001:2023, Annex A. Summaries are original;
ISO/IEC normative text is not reproduced."
